<Vertical id="interdisciplinary_artifact">
  <Markdown id="artifact_intro">
## Your Research Artifact

This is your accumulated work on the high school dropout analysis. Review your progress and outputs from each step of the interdisciplinary research process.
  </Markdown>

  <!-- Step 1: Problem Statement -->
  <Collapsible id="artifact_step1" title="Step 1: Define the problem or state the research question">
    <Markdown>
Your comprehensive problem statement that addresses:
- Why the problem is important (significance)
- Why it's unresolved
- Focus and scope aligned with Comm360's capacity
    </Markdown>

    <Tabs id="repko_step_1">
      <Vertical id="initial_ps" title="Initial Problem Statement">
        <Markdown id="initial_ps_md1">
We've been asked to investigate the causes of high school dropout so Comm360 can develop services to address the problem.
        </Markdown>
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="artifact_tb_2" title="Significance Statement">
        <TextArea id="interdisciplinary_sba_problem_statement_revised" placeholder="Your revision of Peggy's significance statement goes here..." />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="artifact_tb_1" title="Final Problem Statement">
        <TextArea id="interdisciplinary_sba_full_problem_statement" placeholder="Your final problem statement will appear here once completed..." />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>
  </Collapsible>

  <!-- Step 2: Justification -->
  <Collapsible id="artifact_step2" title="Step 2: Justify using an interdisciplinary approach">
    <Tabs id="bm_step2">
      <Vertical id="bm_step2_criteria" title="Criteria">
        <Use id="broad_model_display3" ref="repko_criteria" />
      </Vertical>
      <Vertical id="bm_step2_eval" title="My Initial Evaluation">
        <Use id="initial_repko_evaluation2" ref="initial_repko_evaluation" />
      </Vertical>
    </Tabs>
  </Collapsible>

  <!-- Step 3: Relevant Disciplines -->
  <Collapsible id="artifact_step3" title="Step 3: Identify relevant disciplines">
    <Markdown>
The disciplines you've identified as relevant to understanding high school dropout.
    </Markdown>
    <Tabs>
        <Vertical id="initial_discipline_list" title="Initial Brainstorming">
          <IntakeGate ready="@reason_explanation.value">
            <Markdown>
When you have finished brainstorming disciplines that might be relevant to studying
the causes of high school dropout, this page will display a list of causes of high
school dropout and your personal list of potentially relevant disciplines.
            </Markdown>
            <Vertical id="brainstorming_responses">
              <Use id="brainstorming_disciplines2" ref="brainstorming_disciplines" />
              <Markdown>
-----------------------------------
&nbsp;
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="reasons_shown3" ref="reasons_shown" />
              <Markdown>
-----------------------------------
**Why you selected these causes:**
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="reason_explanation2" ref="reason_explanation" />
              <Markdown>
-----------------------------------
**The causes you suggested yourself:**
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="cause_internal2" ref="cause_internal" />
              <Use id="cause_structural2" ref="cause_structural" />             
              <Markdown>
------------------------------------
**My Notes on the Focus Group Transcript** 
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="" ref="focus_group" />
            </Vertical>
          </IntakeGate>
        </Vertical>
        <Vertical id="identifying_disciplines" title="Identifying Relevant Disciplines">
            <IntakeGate ready="Object.keys(@discipline_mapping.value).length > 3">
              <Markdown>
When you have have finished thinking about which causes of high school dropout
Comm360 should focus on, this page will display your judgments about which disciplines provide information
about each cause.
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="causes_by_disciplines_final" ref="causes_by_disciplines" />
            </IntakeGate>
        </Vertical>
        <Vertical id="mapping_of_causes" title="Final Mapping">
            <IntakeGate ready="Object.keys(@discipline_mapping.value).length > 3">
              <Markdown>
When you have finished analyzing which disciplines study which causes of high school dropout,
this page will display a diagram showing your group's final analysis.
              </Markdown>
              <Use id="causes_by_disciplines_final" ref="causes_by_disciplines_answers" />
            </IntakeGate>
        </Vertical>
    </Tabs>
  </Collapsible>

